{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SEARCH ALL - BONES</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A hidden object game where your task is to discover all the hidden bones in a vast game area. The bones are located in the most unexpected corners: from obvious to almost invisible. Animated elements add liveliness to the locations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106520/extras/92b87e122c7ca419e483df1dca782399.poster.avif?t=1762003314\" width=486 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106520/extras/92b87e122c7ca419e483df1dca782399.webm?t=1762003314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106520/extras/92b87e122c7ca419e483df1dca782399.mp4?t=1762003314\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Among the key features:</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An animated environment</strong> that creates an atmosphere of movement and life around you. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>100 dice</strong>: each found copy brings you closer to victory! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tips:</strong> If the search is delayed, help is available at the touch of a button. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pleasant musical accompaniment</strong> that adds to the enjoyment of the gameplay. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ability to <strong>pause the game at any time</strong>, saving the progress made.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Start the exciting adventure of finding all the bones right now!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Find all","path":"https://cdn.ak